OL,3,GNEWSATriple killer admits murdering Ian
OL,4,AHuntley in jail
OL,5,
OL,6,FA triple killer has admitted murdering
OL,7,Fchild-killer Ian Huntley in prison
OL,8,Fafter changing his plea.
OL,10,FAnthony Russell, 44, had initially
OL,11,Fdenied intentionally killing Huntley,
OL,12,F52, at the high security Frankland
OL,13,FPrison, near Durham, in February, but
OL,14,Fadmitted manslaughter.
OL,16,FRussell, who beat Huntley to death with
OL,17,Fa metal bar, changed his plea on the
OL,18,Fsecond day of his trial at Newcastle
OL,19,FCrown Court.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
